      "title": "  How to add a YouTube video ",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-14T10:02:11Z",
      "draft": false,
      "body": "<p>You can play YouTube videos on your screens.</p><h2><strong>Add the YouTube app</strong></h2><ol><li>Go to <a href=\"/hc/en-us/articles/360000001111-Files\">Files/Assets</a>.</li><li>Click <strong>Add Asset</strong> then <strong>YouTube</strong>.</li></ol><p><img src=\"//support.optisigns.com/hc/article_attachments/1/yt.png\" alt=\"YouTube app\"></p><p><iframe src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/abc123\"></iframe></p><h2>Settings</h2><table><tr><th>Setting</th><th>Meaning</th></tr><tr><td>Mute</td><td>Plays without sound</td></tr></table><div class=\"article-votes\">Was this article helpful?</div>"
